  "lyrics": "[00:00.24]Heat turned up\n[00:01.68]every every every every\n[00:06.08]stare feel loud\n[00:08.08]Slow it down\n[00:09.20]Summer drip\n[00:10.16]Summer drip\n[00:11.20]Hips flip flip\n[00:12.72]walk mean\n[00:13.28]mean mean mean mean\n[00:16.96]I feel this sundress glow under the daylight\n[00:20.72]Hips swing slow moving smooth in the midnight\n[00:24.80]Heart stay cold but my stride got flame\n[00:28.88]Every little step got a high class game\n[00:32.56]Smile so sweet with the timing just right\n[00:36.88]Brown skin shine with the streetlamp light\n[00:40.40]Perfume thick got em stuck in a bind\n[00:44.24]all all all these hungry eyes\n[00:46.32]got em losing they mind\n[00:49.60]Walked in the spot had to savor my tone\n[00:51.68]Whole room staring like a queen on a throne\n[00:53.68]Dance floor quiet but the glances loud\n[00:55.52]Every lens locked in every whisper so proud\n[00:57.52]Long legs soft hands curves on the rise",
